# slideSonnet narration — deck: error-showcase.pdf
# This sidecar is deliberately broken to demo every reconciliation finding.

@all-good
The control case. This slide has a stable id and this narration, so every
check passes.

@twin
Two pages claim this id, so it is ambiguous which one I belong to.

@double-block
I am the first of two blocks for this slide.

@double-block
I am the second block for the same slide. The checker flags us as duplicates.

@ghost-slide
This narration belongs to a slide that no longer exists in the PDF. It shows
up in the editor's unattached-narration tray, where you can re-attach or
delete it.
